area/project note has a soft cap on its Ready lane [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim](plan.max_ready_per_note, default 5, per-note ready_cap override). [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Crowded notes are named, counted, and easy to act on: in a new `bob[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]ready` CLI view, a dash CROWDED chip that opens crowded.md, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]live chip on each note's `## Tasks` heading. All surfaces share one[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]read-time contract, implemented in Rust and in bob-ledger-tools and[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]pinned by shared vectors. The keymap-notice work is fully specified[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and filed to start after the freshness trial.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]per_note_ready_cap.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/per_note_ready_cap.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-3f[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-3f/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ready-lane-per-note contract, config, and Rust evaluator[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add plan.max_ready_per_note and the ready_cap frontmatter. Extend [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the area/project classifier to list forms. Build the Rust note_ready [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]evaluator (counts, states, make-up, lints) on the freshness snapshot. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Document the contract and vectors R1–R14 in docs/plan.md, and record the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]new decision memory.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob ready command[/bold #D7AFFF]                                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: add the read-only top-level `bob ready [NOTE]`: a colored [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CROWDED/FULL/ROOM bar view, a per-note worklist, schema-1 JSON, --check [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](exit 3), --cap preview, and --all. Includes help, README, justfile [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]smoke, and integration tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-ledger-tools noteReady API[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ledger-api[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ledger-api: add api.noteReady v1 (snapshot, forNote, counted, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inCrowdedNote, groupLabel), built in one memoized O(tasks) pass with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]live invalidation. Also a stat-cached loadPlanCaps, a shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]getFileCache frontmatter reader (fixes bob-cli-3e), and the R1–R14 JS [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]vectors. Deploys the plugin.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]CROWDED chip, bob-ready-notes block, and Tasks heading chip[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ledger-views[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ledger-api[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ledger-views: add the live renderCrowdedChip, the bob-ready-notes [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ranked-bar code block, and the `## Tasks` heading chip (CM6 widget plus [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Reading view). Adds theme-safe CSS, the bob-cli-3d anchor-class fix, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one consolidated live-refresh fan-out. Deploys the plugin.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Vault rollout, docs, and live verification[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli, ledger-views[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rollout: add the dash CROWDED chip and the new crowded.md page. Set [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ready_cap: off on the three inboxes, add CROWDED to the morning ritual [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and `bob ready -a` to the weekly prune, add a sase.md triage task, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]log the trial. Updates the plan and freshness docs, cross-checks the CLI[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]against the plugin, and records verification evidence.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-3f","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-3f.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-5a1b6a66f6bd51e21f6ce26872163b96","started_at":"2026-10-01T21:57:30.860556+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"afc12a39fff6369f62214221f5ebf640cad88bcfa61fb7f132127b792c0d5fc5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-3f.3/chat.md","size_bytes":3435},"commits":{"digest":"b22788b60e2e1d15531c4eeb8197b51852148917301ab4c4addff7bd1eaf6a16","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-3f.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-3f.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"a114a58a9ac76ba36d24b8220ee3ca973b61ee48239f13ac21c369fafd757755","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-3f.3/meta.json","size_bytes":718},"prompt":{"digest":"0db28f9b1dd13286a3b9981aba84694e497117ff897c12446699cd9bdd903703","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-3f.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":159},"state":{"digest":"099e241f0a4